{
  "name" : "Schokker2013 - A mathematical model representing cellular immune development and response to Salmonella of chicken intestinal tissue",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>This is a dynamic mathematical model describing the development of the cellular branch of the intestinal immune system of poultry during the first 42 days of life, and of its response towards an oral infection with Salmonella enterica serovar Enteritidis.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
  "format" : {
